{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Eleven members of the Middle School Math Club each paid the same amount for a guest speaker to talk about problem solving at their math club meeting. They paid their guest speaker <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb99859c2e058de47d90e7e0178d95aa9ece1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar\\underline{1} \\underline{A} \\underline{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"19\" />. What is the missing digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef8339ba8637c01d1a69db99c366d4e8da3e8f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }3\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all the eleven members paid the same amount, that means that the total must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We can do some trial-and-error to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a73e337d455df9943a5fcd2af1514061aa060ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/785ae0b607d8abd0b54e587b1b40f21042564f03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n~SparklyFlowers\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that a number is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> if the odd digits added together minus the even digits added together (or vice versa) is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/6/976ad77b1b2ac88d023fcfd2375d7313da3642f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2-A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> = a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The only multiple that works here is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/ddaefaf1a93ee56bcafc386d7e60b17fd484f580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 \\cdot 0 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e83baf6bf2f40cacc65a97cd112dc18bc5af7376.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n~fn106068\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If you know your multiplication tables up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c214381593023e805a156e6e1f3437096032fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12*12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, you know that the out of the choices provided, the only number with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad5acb873536c2964c39ece558ace6e15ad54347.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1A2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> that is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/17531b756bc19a5c07c7f1ab8ce1cddf4bb4097c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$132$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d9966f3f056284135a0b292db443bde2157eca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12*11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/785ae0b607d8abd0b54e587b1b40f21042564f03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. ~Jupiter10\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kNHe_IMcMiU\">https://youtu.be/kNHe_IMcMiU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mHWTWk-xt0o\">https://youtu.be/mHWTWk-xt0o</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"